<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Flash</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 28)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast flash &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast flash</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The first of the colour spells: a blinding flash of colours sears the 
target's mind. The better your power and mind sphere, the more it hurts. It 
does most against those in plate and chain, and least against clothes. A 
shield takes some of it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls. Stronger colour spells follow: colourbeam, colourspray 
and flashing grip.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourbeam</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourspray</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Flashing Grip</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>